                                        "answer": "Hi Jane! \ud83c\udf1f\n\nWhile I can't provide specific details about our return or exchange policy, I can suggest some fantastic items that would complement your previous purchases! \n\nSince you got the **EcoFire Camping Stove**, you might love pairing it with the **MountainDream Sleeping Bag** for cozy nights under the stars. \ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f And if you're planning some hikes with your **TrekReady Hiking Boots**, the **TrailBlaze Hiking Pants** would be a stylish and functional addition to your outdoor wardrobe! \ud83d\udc56\n\nIf you have any other questions, feel free to ask! \ud83d\ude0a"
